Print "=== Secure File I/O Demo ===".

Print "Creating a dynamic buffer (no size needed!)".
A buffer called contents.

Print "Writing to file...".
Open a file for writing called output at "./secure_test.txt".
Write "Line 1: Hello from secure file I/O!" to output.
Write a newline to output.
Write "Line 2: Buffers grow automatically." to output.
Write a newline to output.
Write "Line 3: Files auto-close on exit if forgotten." to output.
Close the output.

Print "Reading back...".
Open a file for reading called source at "./secure_test.txt".
Read from source into contents.
Close the source.

Print "Contents:".
Print contents.

Print "Cleaning up...".
Delete the file "./secure_test.txt".

Print "Done! All resources auto-cleaned.".
